{"id":"662752","name":"咕噜虾仁","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662752/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"菠萝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青圆椒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将虾去壳去虾线后洗净。","img":"images/662752/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将虾仁开一下背。","img":"images/662752/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"虾仁加入少许胡椒粉抓拌均匀。","img":"images/662752/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"青椒和红椒洗净切块。","img":"images/662752/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"菠萝切块备用。","img":"images/662752/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"碗中放入番茄酱，白砂糖，玉米淀粉，白醋。","img":"images/662752/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量清水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/662752/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"虾仁加入小酥肉粉。","img":"images/662752/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/662752/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"抓拌均匀裹上面粉。","img":"images/662752/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅中热油放入虾仁，中小火炸至金黄捞出。","img":"images/662752/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再把虾仁大火复炸。","img":"images/662752/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅中热油放入彩椒翻炒。","img":"images/662752/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入菠萝翻炒。","img":"images/662752/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"倒入调好的酱汁。","img":"images/662752/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"大火煮开搅拌均匀。","img":"images/662752/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"倒入炸好的虾仁，大火快速翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/662752/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662752/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662752/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}